### 1. Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 2. Create Workspace (if needed)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Invite Test Workspace"
}

### 3. Create Invite
# @name createInvite
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### Save invite token from response
# @name inviteToken = {{createInvite.response.data.inviteLink.split('=')[1]}}

### 4. Check Invite (Public - No Auth)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/invites/check?token={{inviteToken}}

### 5. Register New User (if needed)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "User",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 6. Login as New User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 7. Accept Invite (as New User)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/invites/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer NEW_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "token": "{{inviteToken}}"
}

### 8. Get Workspace Invites (as Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/invites
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 9. Revoke Invite
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/invites/INVITE_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN